<title>DENMARK: Danish April retail sales rise - statistics office.</title>
<headline>Danish April retail sales rise - statistics office.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's seasonally adjusted retail sales index fell to 110.60 in March, but rose to 112.80 in April 1997 compared to a revised 112.21 in February 1997, the national statistics office said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
